[
    {
        "start": 0,
        "stop": 1.56,
        "text": " Alright, let's get right into"
    },
    {
        "start": 1.56,
        "stop": 2.96,
        "text": " it. Today we're talking about"
    },
    {
        "start": 2.96,
        "stop": 4.61,
        "text": " something called PMKR. That"
    },
    {
        "start": 4.61,
        "stop": 5.01,
        "text": " stands"
    },
    {
        "start": 5.01,
        "stop": 6.83,
        "text": " for Procedural Memory Knowledge"
    },
    {
        "start": 6.83,
        "stop": 8.77,
        "text": " Representation. And yeah, it's"
    },
    {
        "start": 8.77,
        "stop": 10.51,
        "text": " a new W3C spec, but stick with"
    },
    {
        "start": 10.51,
        "stop": 10.98,
        "text": " me here."
    },
    {
        "start": 10.98,
        "stop": 12.29,
        "text": " This is not just another dry"
    },
    {
        "start": 12.29,
        "stop": 13.7,
        "text": " technical standard. It's"
    },
    {
        "start": 13.7,
        "stop": 15.02,
        "text": " actually a proposed fix for a"
    },
    {
        "start": 15.02,
        "stop": 15.62,
        "text": " massive,"
    },
    {
        "start": 15.62,
        "stop": 16.95,
        "text": " colossal problem of digital"
    },
    {
        "start": 16.95,
        "stop": 18.21,
        "text": " waste. A problem that's"
    },
    {
        "start": 18.21,
        "stop": 19.62,
        "text": " silently bloating our entire"
    },
    {
        "start": 19.62,
        "stop": 20.56,
        "text": " digital world."
    },
    {
        "start": 20.56,
        "stop": 23.07,
        "text": " So, what is this crisis? Well,"
    },
    {
        "start": 23.07,
        "stop": 25.39,
        "text": " it's a crisis of duplication."
    },
    {
        "start": 25.39,
        "stop": 27.84,
        "text": " It's like this invisible plague"
    },
    {
        "start": 27.84,
        "stop": 29.59,
        "text": " where the exact same piece of"
    },
    {
        "start": 29.59,
        "stop": 30.86,
        "text": " information, the same bit of"
    },
    {
        "start": 30.86,
        "stop": 32.45,
        "text": " knowledge gets copied and re-"
    },
    {
        "start": 32.45,
        "stop": 32.96,
        "text": "encoded"
    },
    {
        "start": 32.96,
        "stop": 34.79,
        "text": " and stored over and over and"
    },
    {
        "start": 34.79,
        "stop": 37.04,
        "text": " over again. And all that duplic"
    },
    {
        "start": 37.04,
        "stop": 39.32,
        "text": "ation creates just immense bloat"
    },
    {
        "start": 39.32,
        "stop": 39.68,
        "text": " across"
    },
    {
        "start": 39.68,
        "stop": 41.43,
        "text": " everything we do online. To"
    },
    {
        "start": 41.43,
        "stop": 42.96,
        "text": " really get a grip on this, let"
    },
    {
        "start": 42.96,
        "stop": 44.61,
        "text": "'s take a super simple, really"
    },
    {
        "start": 44.61,
        "stop": 44.98,
        "text": " common"
    },
    {
        "start": 44.98,
        "stop": 46.58,
        "text": " example. The Greek letter sigma"
    },
    {
        "start": 46.58,
        "stop": 47.73,
        "text": ". You know, the one we use for"
    },
    {
        "start": 47.73,
        "stop": 48.89,
        "text": " summation. Seems pretty"
    },
    {
        "start": 48.89,
        "stop": 49.84,
        "text": " straightforward,"
    },
    {
        "start": 49.84,
        "stop": 51.59,
        "text": " right? But if you were to ask a"
    },
    {
        "start": 51.59,
        "stop": 53.04,
        "text": " computer, hey, where does this"
    },
    {
        "start": 53.04,
        "stop": 54.7,
        "text": " symbol actually live? Well, the"
    },
    {
        "start": 54.7,
        "stop": 55.22,
        "text": " answer is"
    },
    {
        "start": 55.22,
        "stop": 56.31,
        "text": " way more complicated than you'd"
    },
    {
        "start": 56.31,
        "stop": 57.45,
        "text": " think. And here's the thing you"
    },
    {
        "start": 57.45,
        "stop": 58.79,
        "text": "'ve got to understand. Every"
    },
    {
        "start": 58.79,
        "stop": 59.14,
        "text": " single"
    },
    {
        "start": 59.14,
        "stop": 60.36,
        "text": " one of these is a totally"
    },
    {
        "start": 60.36,
        "stop": 61.57,
        "text": " separate, completely"
    },
    {
        "start": 61.57,
        "stop": 63.28,
        "text": " disconnected copy. The visual"
    },
    {
        "start": 63.28,
        "stop": 64.09,
        "text": " shape of sigma"
    },
    {
        "start": 64.09,
        "stop": 65.4,
        "text": " stored in a font file, it has"
    },
    {
        "start": 65.4,
        "stop": 66.73,
        "text": " no idea that it's supposed to"
    },
    {
        "start": 66.73,
        "stop": 68.11,
        "text": " be a mathematical operator in"
    },
    {
        "start": 68.11,
        "stop": 68.31,
        "text": " an"
    },
    {
        "start": 68.31,
        "stop": 70.15,
        "text": " equation. Its representation in"
    },
    {
        "start": 70.15,
        "stop": 71.62,
        "text": " an AI model is another island"
    },
    {
        "start": 71.62,
        "stop": 73.28,
        "text": " altogether. This isn't just"
    },
    {
        "start": 73.28,
        "stop": 75.03,
        "text": " inefficient, it's a maintenance"
    },
    {
        "start": 75.03,
        "stop": 76.19,
        "text": " nightmare. Every time we use"
    },
    {
        "start": 76.19,
        "stop": 77.89,
        "text": " this one little symbol, we're"
    },
    {
        "start": 77.89,
        "stop": 78.09,
        "text": " creating"
    },
    {
        "start": 78.09,
        "stop": 79.84,
        "text": " another brand new isolated"
    },
    {
        "start": 79.84,
        "stop": 81.45,
        "text": " piece of data. So what's the"
    },
    {
        "start": 81.45,
        "stop": 83.24,
        "text": " solution? Well, what's so"
    },
    {
        "start": 83.24,
        "stop": 84.66,
        "text": " remarkable here is that"
    },
    {
        "start": 84.66,
        "stop": 86.45,
        "text": " it's not some crazy futuristic"
    },
    {
        "start": 86.45,
        "stop": 87.94,
        "text": " new concept. The fix is"
    },
    {
        "start": 87.94,
        "stop": 89.56,
        "text": " actually an idea that's been"
    },
    {
        "start": 89.56,
        "stop": 91.78,
        "text": " around for about 40,000"
    },
    {
        "start": 91.78,
        "stop": 93.58,
        "text": " years. It's a reflection of how"
    },
    {
        "start": 93.58,
        "stop": 95.27,
        "text": " we humans have always, always"
    },
    {
        "start": 95.27,
        "stop": 97.28,
        "text": " learned to represent knowledge."
    },
    {
        "start": 97.52,
        "stop": 99.27,
        "text": " Just think about how we evolved"
    },
    {
        "start": 99.27,
        "stop": 100.82,
        "text": ". We started with pure form,"
    },
    {
        "start": 100.82,
        "stop": 102.48,
        "text": " literally just visual marks on"
    },
    {
        "start": 102.48,
        "stop": 104.24,
        "text": " a cave wall. Then over"
    },
    {
        "start": 104.24,
        "stop": 105.74,
        "text": " thousands of years, we started"
    },
    {
        "start": 105.74,
        "stop": 107.02,
        "text": " attaching meaning to those"
    },
    {
        "start": 107.02,
        "stop": 108.76,
        "text": " forms, and we got pictographs."
    },
    {
        "start": 108.76,
        "stop": 109.98,
        "text": " After that, we standardized"
    },
    {
        "start": 109.98,
        "stop": 111.54,
        "text": " them into alphabets. Then we"
    },
    {
        "start": 111.54,
        "stop": 113.12,
        "text": " invented rules, like grammar,"
    },
    {
        "start": 113.12,
        "stop": 114.82,
        "text": " to combine them. And eventually"
    },
    {
        "start": 114.82,
        "stop": 116.39,
        "text": " we developed meta rules, things"
    },
    {
        "start": 116.39,
        "stop": 117.85,
        "text": " like logic and philosophy, to"
    },
    {
        "start": 117.85,
        "stop": 119.42,
        "text": " help us reason about the rules"
    },
    {
        "start": 119.42,
        "stop": 120.08,
        "text": " themselves."
    },
    {
        "start": 120.08,
        "stop": 121.83,
        "text": " You see the pattern? It's a"
    },
    {
        "start": 121.83,
        "stop": 123.44,
        "text": " natural climb from concrete"
    },
    {
        "start": 123.44,
        "stop": 125.43,
        "text": " shapes to abstract strategy."
    },
    {
        "start": 125.43,
        "stop": 127.08,
        "text": " And that brings us right to the"
    },
    {
        "start": 127.08,
        "stop": 128.97,
        "text": " heart of the PMKR specification"
    },
    {
        "start": 128.97,
        "stop": 130.32,
        "text": ". It takes this exact"
    },
    {
        "start": 130.32,
        "stop": 132.05,
        "text": " evolutionary pattern and cod"
    },
    {
        "start": 132.05,
        "stop": 133.72,
        "text": "ifies it into a modern, four"
    },
    {
        "start": 133.72,
        "stop": 135.91,
        "text": " layer technical architecture."
    },
    {
        "start": 135.91,
        "stop": 138.03,
        "text": " This hierarchy is absolutely"
    },
    {
        "start": 138.03,
        "stop": 139.8,
        "text": " crucial. So at the very bottom,"
    },
    {
        "start": 139.8,
        "stop": 141.44,
        "text": " you have the form layer. These"
    },
    {
        "start": 141.44,
        "stop": 142.61,
        "text": " are the raw procedural"
    },
    {
        "start": 142.61,
        "stop": 144.13,
        "text": " instructions, like how to"
    },
    {
        "start": 144.13,
        "stop": 145.44,
        "text": " actually draw the strokes of"
    },
    {
        "start": 145.44,
        "stop": 147.03,
        "text": " the letter A. Then sitting on"
    },
    {
        "start": 147.03,
        "stop": 148.3,
        "text": " top of that is the meaning"
    },
    {
        "start": 148.3,
        "stop": 149.97,
        "text": " layer, which says, hey,"
    },
    {
        "start": 149.97,
        "stop": 151.19,
        "text": " that specific form you just"
    },
    {
        "start": 151.19,
        "stop": 152.52,
        "text": " drew, that specific form you"
    },
    {
        "start": 152.52,
        "stop": 153.88,
        "text": " just drew, that is the letter A"
    },
    {
        "start": 153.88,
        "stop": 155.41,
        "text": ". Next up, the rules layer gives"
    },
    {
        "start": 155.41,
        "stop": 156.62,
        "text": " us executable logic, like"
    },
    {
        "start": 156.62,
        "stop": 157.91,
        "text": " grammar, for combining all"
    },
    {
        "start": 157.91,
        "stop": 159.41,
        "text": " those meanings. And at the very"
    },
    {
        "start": 159.41,
        "stop": 160.58,
        "text": " top, the meta rules layer"
    },
    {
        "start": 160.58,
        "stop": 162.07,
        "text": " provides the strategy, the high"
    },
    {
        "start": 162.07,
        "stop": 163.56,
        "text": " level control that decides"
    },
    {
        "start": 163.56,
        "stop": 165.22,
        "text": " which rules to apply and when."
    },
    {
        "start": 165.22,
        "stop": 166.6,
        "text": " And this parallel is just"
    },
    {
        "start": 166.6,
        "stop": 168.57,
        "text": " perfect. The form layer, that's"
    },
    {
        "start": 168.57,
        "stop": 170.48,
        "text": " our ancient cave paintings. The"
    },
    {
        "start": 170.48,
        "stop": 172.06,
        "text": " meaning layer is when we came"
    },
    {
        "start": 172.06,
        "stop": 174.03,
        "text": " up with words and concepts. The"
    },
    {
        "start": 174.03,
        "stop": 175.68,
        "text": " rules layer, well, that's our"
    },
    {
        "start": 175.68,
        "stop": 177.6,
        "text": " grammar, our formulas. And the"
    },
    {
        "start": 177.6,
        "stop": 179.31,
        "text": " meta rules layer is our ability"
    },
    {
        "start": 179.31,
        "stop": 179.88,
        "text": " to use"
    },
    {
        "start": 179.88,
        "stop": 181.63,
        "text": " logic and strategy. All PMKR"
    },
    {
        "start": 181.63,
        "stop": 183.45,
        "text": " does is make this ancient, time"
    },
    {
        "start": 183.45,
        "stop": 185.23,
        "text": "-tested structure something a"
    },
    {
        "start": 185.23,
        "stop": 187.05,
        "text": " computer can understand and use"
    },
    {
        "start": 187.05,
        "stop": 188.52,
        "text": ". So how does this clever"
    },
    {
        "start": 188.52,
        "stop": 190.23,
        "text": " layered model actually solve"
    },
    {
        "start": 190.23,
        "stop": 192.12,
        "text": " our duplication crisis? It all"
    },
    {
        "start": 192.12,
        "stop": 193.88,
        "text": " comes down to a really powerful"
    },
    {
        "start": 193.88,
        "stop": 195.69,
        "text": " but simple idea called the save"
    },
    {
        "start": 195.69,
        "stop": 197.83,
        "text": " information principle. And it's"
    },
    {
        "start": 197.83,
        "stop": 199.44,
        "text": " exactly what it sounds like."
    },
    {
        "start": 199.44,
        "stop": 201.24,
        "text": " You store a piece of knowledge"
    },
    {
        "start": 201.24,
        "stop": 202.81,
        "text": " one time in its most basic form"
    },
    {
        "start": 202.81,
        "stop": 204.63,
        "text": ". And every other time you need"
    },
    {
        "start": 204.63,
        "stop": 206.38,
        "text": " it, you just use a lightweight"
    },
    {
        "start": 206.38,
        "stop": 207.94,
        "text": " pointer back to that single"
    },
    {
        "start": 207.94,
        "stop": 209.78,
        "text": " source of truth. The technical"
    },
    {
        "start": 209.78,
        "stop": 211.53,
        "text": " name for this is Simlink style"
    },
    {
        "start": 211.53,
        "stop": 213.35,
        "text": " composition. And you know what?"
    },
    {
        "start": 213.35,
        "stop": 214.54,
        "text": " If you've ever created a"
    },
    {
        "start": 214.54,
        "stop": 215.84,
        "text": " shortcut to a file on your"
    },
    {
        "start": 215.84,
        "stop": 217.67,
        "text": " computer, you basically already"
    },
    {
        "start": 217.67,
        "stop": 219.17,
        "text": " get it. You're not making a"
    },
    {
        "start": 219.17,
        "stop": 220.6,
        "text": " whole new copy of the file,"
    },
    {
        "start": 220.6,
        "stop": 222.22,
        "text": " right? You're just making a"
    },
    {
        "start": 222.22,
        "stop": 223.86,
        "text": " tiny little pointer that says,"
    },
    {
        "start": 223.86,
        "stop": 225.23,
        "text": " hey, the real file is over"
    },
    {
        "start": 225.23,
        "stop": 226.97,
        "text": " there. PMKR does the exact same"
    },
    {
        "start": 226.97,
        "stop": 228.59,
        "text": " thing, but for every tiny unit"
    },
    {
        "start": 228.59,
        "stop": 230.79,
        "text": " of knowledge. Now, let's look"
    },
    {
        "start": 230.79,
        "stop": 232.26,
        "text": " at the real world impact. In"
    },
    {
        "start": 232.26,
        "stop": 233.83,
        "text": " the old way, if you have a"
    },
    {
        "start": 233.83,
        "stop": 235.28,
        "text": " thousand different rules that"
    },
    {
        "start": 235.28,
        "stop": 237.02,
        "text": " all need the partial derivative"
    },
    {
        "start": 237.02,
        "stop": 238.67,
        "text": " symbol, you'd store a five kil"
    },
    {
        "start": 238.67,
        "stop": 239.68,
        "text": "obyte copy of it"
    },
    {
        "start": 239.68,
        "stop": 241.91,
        "text": " 1000 times. That's five meg"
    },
    {
        "start": 241.91,
        "stop": 243.82,
        "text": "abytes. Now in the PMKR way, you"
    },
    {
        "start": 243.82,
        "stop": 245.58,
        "text": " store that symbol just once."
    },
    {
        "start": 245.58,
        "stop": 247.2,
        "text": " Each of those thousand rules"
    },
    {
        "start": 247.2,
        "stop": 248.61,
        "text": " then uses a tiny four byte"
    },
    {
        "start": 248.61,
        "stop": 250.56,
        "text": " reference. The grand total, we"
    },
    {
        "start": 250.56,
        "stop": 252.44,
        "text": "'re talking about four kilobytes"
    },
    {
        "start": 252.44,
        "stop": 254.02,
        "text": ". I mean, that's not just a"
    },
    {
        "start": 254.02,
        "stop": 255.64,
        "text": " small improvement. It's a"
    },
    {
        "start": 255.64,
        "stop": 257.63,
        "text": " complete paradigm shift. And"
    },
    {
        "start": 257.63,
        "stop": 259.14,
        "text": " when you apply this principle"
    },
    {
        "start": 259.14,
        "stop": 261.05,
        "text": " across entire knowledge bases,"
    },
    {
        "start": 261.05,
        "stop": 262.79,
        "text": " you see an average compression"
    },
    {
        "start": 262.79,
        "stop": 264.8,
        "text": " of over 70%. That is a direct"
    },
    {
        "start": 264.8,
        "stop": 266.36,
        "text": " massive benefit that you get"
    },
    {
        "start": 266.36,
        "stop": 267.91,
        "text": " just by not being redundant"
    },
    {
        "start": 267.91,
        "stop": 269.58,
        "text": " anymore. But this"
    },
    {
        "start": 269.58,
        "stop": 271.33,
        "text": " incredible efficiency, that's"
    },
    {
        "start": 271.33,
        "stop": 273.14,
        "text": " really just the beginning. This"
    },
    {
        "start": 273.14,
        "stop": 274.74,
        "text": " architecture makes something"
    },
    {
        "start": 274.74,
        "stop": 276.35,
        "text": " else possible, something far"
    },
    {
        "start": 276.35,
        "stop": 277.89,
        "text": " more profound for the world of"
    },
    {
        "start": 277.89,
        "stop": 279.83,
        "text": " AI. It's called the dual client"
    },
    {
        "start": 279.83,
        "stop": 281.32,
        "text": " contract. And it means having a"
    },
    {
        "start": 281.32,
        "stop": 282.83,
        "text": " single shared source of truth"
    },
    {
        "start": 282.83,
        "stop": 284.04,
        "text": " that can be understood"
    },
    {
        "start": 284.04,
        "stop": 285.52,
        "text": " perfectly by both humans and"
    },
    {
        "start": 285.52,
        "stop": 287.72,
        "text": " machines. Okay, so check this"
    },
    {
        "start": 287.72,
        "stop": 289.58,
        "text": " out. When a human, that's us,"
    },
    {
        "start": 289.58,
        "stop": 291.47,
        "text": " sees the visual Sigma symbol,"
    },
    {
        "start": 291.47,
        "stop": 293.26,
        "text": " an AI looking at the exact same"
    },
    {
        "start": 293.26,
        "stop": 294.87,
        "text": " source file sees the underlying"
    },
    {
        "start": 294.87,
        "stop": 296.41,
        "text": " program that defines it as a"
    },
    {
        "start": 296.41,
        "stop": 298.33,
        "text": " mathematical operator. A human"
    },
    {
        "start": 298.33,
        "stop": 299.48,
        "text": " sees a save icon,"
    },
    {
        "start": 299.48,
        "stop": 301.23,
        "text": " but the AI sees an executable"
    },
    {
        "start": 301.23,
        "stop": 302.51,
        "text": " command at action save. It's"
    },
    {
        "start": 302.51,
        "stop": 304.08,
        "text": " one single piece of knowledge"
    },
